{"id":"wb-6-708","name":"眉山报恩寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"报恩寺 (眉山)","text":"眉山报恩寺位于中国四川省眉山市东坡区永寿镇高丰村。报恩寺始建于唐，现仅存元泰定四年（1327年）所建的大殿，清乾隆二十六年（1761年）曾予大修。大殿采用抬梁式木构架，单檐歇山顶，保留了宋代的建筑风格。\n1991年4月16日公布为四川省第三批文物保护单位，2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA_(%E7%9C%89%E5%B1%B1)","revisionId":86590116,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86590116","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dcc48b722741a60d7e1a71b5.jpg","title":"眉山报恩寺照片.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%9C%89%E5%B1%B1%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/%E7%9C%89%E5%B1%B1%E6%8A%A5%E6%81%A9%E5%AF%BA%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Bao'en temple in Meishan","width":320,"height":222}}